了好几遍。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"9":{"step":[[9,10,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她在门厅里晃悠着，闲得无聊，便读起柱子上贴着的《禁酤酒诏》。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"10":{"step":[[10,11,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"11":{"step":[[11,12,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308301.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["我只认得里面的几个字，但这《禁酤酒诏》被客人们念叨过好多好多次。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"12":{"step":[[12,13,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308312.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["我都能背出来了：“酒醪之用，表节制于欢娱……”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"13":{"step":[[13,14,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308301.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["每到闲酒日，老板娘也会读一读，就好像多念一会儿，放酒的日子就会快点到一样。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"14":{"step":[[14,15,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那告示上皆是连篇累牍之词，只在最后写明——","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"15":{"step":[[15,16,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“本城内，大小节日及初一十五为放酒日，饮酒不作限制；其余日子为闲酒日，民众不得聚众喝酒，也不得私自喝酒，酒坊亦不得兜售私酒。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"16":{"step":[[16,17,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308317.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["酒坊不卖酒还能卖什么呢？想出这规矩的人真不灵光，一点都瞧不出大伙儿的所想所要。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"17":{"step":[[17,18,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308301.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["不过……别人越想做什么，就越不让别人做什么，金市的很多规矩都是如此……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"18":{"step":[[18,19,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308301.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["管着金市的里正，算是城里的庇护者吗？那他算不算祥瑞？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"19":{"step":[[19,20,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"20":{"step":[[20,21,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["门前传来叩门声，酒坊依照告示，闲酒日只得开半边门。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"21":{"step":[[21,22,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["只见一个身影闪进前厅中，来人颠着手里的铜钱，自然地打招呼。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"22":{"step":[[22,23,""]],"type":1,"name":["城中居民Ⅳ ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622420.png","audio":"610015522 ","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["许娘子，来三个糟饼子，要刚出炉的，热乎乎的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"23":{"step":[[23,24,""]],"type":1,"name":["城中居民Ⅳ ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622420.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["哎呀呀，还是你家的饼子香，吃一块要惦记三天。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"24":{"step":[[24,25,""]],"type":1,"name":["城中居民Ⅳ ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622420.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["每次都还要赶早来买，晚了就碰不上了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"25":{"step":[[25,26,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["酒坊前厅的桌上，摆着个大扁箩，里面堆着满满的小酥饼。酥饼黄澄澄，似是用米压成的，上面还撒了芝麻，此饼谓之“糟饼子”。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"26":{"step":[[26,27,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["许娘子快手快脚，和平时里上酒一样速度，拣了三个饼子交给来人。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"27":{"step":[[27,28,""]],"type":1,"name":["许娘子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你们喜欢吃就好，也是靠邻里之间照顾生意。酒坊这闲酒日也不能干放着嘛。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"28":{"step":[[28,29,""]],"type":1,"name":["许娘子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["幸而这酿酒余下的东西还能做成饼子。于是也当个营生拿来卖一阵，平日里手也就不闲着了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"29":{"step":[[29,30,""]],"type":1,"name":["城中居民Ⅳ ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622420.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["呦，曲娘也在帮忙，我还以为闲酒日你在后面睡觉呢。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"30":{"step":[[30,31,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308301.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["睡觉？不上工就没吃的，这是世间最简单的道理。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"31":{"step":[[31,32,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308301.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我肯定也没歇着呀，扫地、搬酒一个没落下。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"32":{"step":[[32,33,""]],"type":1,"name":["城中居民Ⅳ ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622420.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["瞧你跟着许娘子，在酒坊里这几日，嘴巴都变利索了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"33":{"step":[[33,34,""]],"type":1,"name":["城中居民Ⅳ ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622420.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["想着当日你刚来酒坊那会儿，像个野地里的孩子，什么都不会。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"34":{"step":[[34,35,""]],"type":1,"name":["城中居民Ⅳ ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622420.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["许娘子对你是又管饭，又管教的。你真是托了她的福气，来日可得好好谢她。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"35":{"step":[[35,36,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308301.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["托了老板娘的福气，唔，福气……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"36":{"step":[[36,37,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这会子，许娘子端出一小盅，从柜台的茶壶里倒了一杯清茶水，请来人解渴。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"37":{"step":[[37,38,""]],"type":1,"name":["城中居民Ⅳ ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622420.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["每次到你这里就渴了，还是许娘子周到，这茶也是上品。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"38":{"step":[[38,39,""]],"type":1,"name":["城中居民Ⅳ ","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622420.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["一杯清茶顺咽喉，万事休矣莫再愁。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"39":{"step":[[39,40,""]],"type":1,"name":["许娘子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["开店的就要有眼力见儿，想客人之所想。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"40":{"step":[[40,41,""]],"type":1,"name":["许娘子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["如此生意才能长久，以后的日子里放酒日少，闲酒日多，我这酒坊还得靠这糟饼子的买卖过活呢。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"41":{"step":[[41,42,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这一日上午，陆陆续续又有不少来买糟饼的，一筐子麻糟饼也去了七八分，当真是来迟了就没有了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_6/1_6_bg_jiufangyuanzhong.jpg","choice":[]},"42":{"step":[[42,43,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["来往客人除了买饼，总要在坊里喝杯茶，一饮而尽，随后才心满意足地走了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"43":{"step":[[43,44,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308301.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["老板娘，我们的饼子卖得真快，每次出去，街上的人都问我有没有剩的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"44":{"step":[[44,45,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308301.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["其实卖糟饼子也不错，不用跑来跑去招呼客人，也不用倒酒盛酒。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"45":{"step":[[45,46,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308301.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["每日守在这里等着客人上门就行，要是可以一直卖饼子就好啦。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"46":{"step":[[46,47,""]],"type":1,"name":["许娘子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你在想什么呢，曲娘，我们这是酒坊，又不是饼子铺。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"47":{"step":[[47,48,""]],"type":1,"name":["许娘子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["别人买饼子，也是因为酒坊的名头，况且要是不卖酒了，这糟饼子的原料也没得来呀。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"48":{"step":[[48,49,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308301.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["不就是和胡饼一样，用麦粉做的嘛。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"49":{"step":[[49,50,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["箩筐里的糟饼子还在散发着香味，对曲娘来说，这味道熟悉又陌生，不过她却从没见过这饼是怎么做成的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"50":{"step":[[50,51,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她夜里都是早早睡了，只知道第二日闻着香儿起床，老板娘老早就做好一筐糟饼子摆上桌了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"51":{"step":[[51,52,""]],"type":1,"name":["许娘子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["所谓糟饼子，和别家不同就在一个“糟”字。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"52":{"step":[[52,53,""]],"type":1,"name":["许娘子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["酒坊做酒，最看中的除了酿酒用的水，还有就是酿酒用的“米”了。黍米、秫米、糯米、稻米，都能酿酒。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"53":{"step":[[53,54,""]],"type":1,"name":["许娘子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你看我平日里从不让人送米来，都是亲自去粮坊里约米，为的就是挑好米。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"54":{"step":[[54,55,""]],"type":1,"name":["许娘子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["米酿完酒后，就变成了酒糟。糟饼子就是用这新酒糟，还有荞麦粉，细细和在一起揉出来的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"55":{"step":[[55,56,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308301.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["原来酒糟也能做饼子，怪不得闻起来比胡饼香。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"56":{"step":[[56,57,""]],"type":1,"name":["许娘子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["香是香，就是做起来呀，比酿酒还累人。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"57":{"step":[[57,58,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["说着许娘子用手点一下曲娘的鼻子尖。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"58":{"step":[[58,59,""]],"type":1,"name":["许娘子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["这糟饼子要刚出炉的才好吃，只放上一天，那香气就要走了大半。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"59":{"step":[[59,60,""]],"type":1,"name":["许娘子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["做这饼子，丑时便要把酒糟从缸里捞起来，寅时就要和面，然后生火，贴在土炉子里，每次要做百十来个。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"60":{"step":[[60,61,""]],"type":1,"name":["许娘子","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"622901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["要不是闲酒日没得营生，这一方邻里坊间又都指着饼子吃，我也没得这样累的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"61":{"step":[[61,62,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308301.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["一方邻里坊间，都指望着老板娘做的糟饼子……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"62":{"step":[[62,63,""]],"type":1,"name":["曲娘","","Jiu Niangzi","","","","",""],"head_icon":"308301.png","audio":"610015572 ","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["众人都需要老板娘……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","ch